// Tests for intent building and signing: the site's payloads must match
// the niara-exchange-engine verifier byte for byte.
//
// 1. Golden vectors: generated by running the engine's own src/intents with fixed
//    TEST keys (v1 and the cancel: commit d5b32d6; v2 and the market-order caps:
//    commit ad3a082; v3, the iceberg: commit 057b979; each signature also accepted by
//    the engine's verifier) — patterned bytes, never
//    used on any network. The signatures are deterministic (ed25519 and
//    ECDSA RFC 6979), so reproducing them proves the whole payload.
// 2. Differential (optional): with NIARA_ENGINE_DIR pointing at the engine
//    repo, it runs the real verifier and checks random intents.
